I can't choose just one, they're all documented

512
00:32:22,000 --> 00:32:25,500
jaga kinke, pappapapon, but first, bread!

513
00:32:25,500 --> 00:32:28,500
Seino, ewwa, kushikake

514
00:32:28,500 --> 00:32:30,500
Ocha-tea-tea

515
00:32:30,500 --> 00:32:33,500
every second, every second, every second, every second

516
00:32:33,500 --> 00:32:36,500
I'll never be able to choose, I'll take them all!

517
